  "summary": "Malicious code in @ornikar/rollup-plugin-postcss (npm)",
  "details": "A trojanized clone of the legitimate rollup-plugin-postcss package. The preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads a Bun binary from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases/download/bun-v1.3.13/ and executes a heavily-obfuscated 727KB payload (math_init.js) through it. The dist/index.js contains a verbatim copy of the real plugin code as camouflage. The obfuscated payload is executed at install time via the preinstall lifecycle hook.",
